+# Review Bundle
+
+This bundle supports the architecture-reviewer worked example.
+
+## Expected outputs
+
+- `candidate/review-report.md`
+- `candidate/repair-plan.md`
+
+The reviewer should capture prioritized findings and a short repair plan so the implementer can
+apply the fixes directly.
+
+## Scope
+
+The review remains additive and local to this bundle root.
